  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "0.5 large yellow onion, chopped",
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "1 (16 ounce) can refried beans",
    "1 (1 ounce) package burrito seasoning",
    "1 (10.75 ounce) can condensed cream of mushroom soup",
    "4 ounces sour cream",
    "1 (14.5 ounce) package tortilla chips",
    "2.5 cups shredded Mexican cheese blend",
    "1 (8 ounce) jar salsa"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Coat a casserole dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w9BYpy3hLwn3zD_H38aDmd7eqvw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-269476-burrito-casserole-step-01-A-c69f4a67b6ba4e4c8b0b014da0e22aa1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269476/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Cook and stir onion in hot oil until translucent, 3 to 5 minutes. Add beef and increase heat to medium-high. Cook and stir until beef is browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cK9P7aZD6bXQnYsuEPU2TcGWbRM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-269476-burrito-casserole-step-02-9f63646688d3499a8c56133cfc6e6834.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269476/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together refried beans and burrito seasoning in a large bowl; add to beef mixture in the skillet and stir until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9B2vNQIOGD3hCSzuX8WPbMXLNKo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-269476-burrito-casserole-step-03-99782d1f8c694984a4691101630344b6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269476/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together condensed soup and sour cream in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WkyA0MZpe06TIj8fFBwwHE1nEb0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-269476-burrito-casserole-step-04-af5f3f5e7a564a3ba29c606fe7a5eeee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269476/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a layer of tortilla chips into the prepared casserole dish to just cover the bottom, followed by 1/2 of the meat mixture, 1/2 of the soup mixture, 1 cup cheese, and 1/2 of the salsa. Repeat layers once more, then top with remaining cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pngZLe_aQJZVoIk-I3Zh3LPZLXM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-269476-burrito-casserole-step-05-6feb4ef68723435d8df6fcfd7b54067a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269476/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven, uncovered, until hot and bubbly, 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1uGHjGQVsnW_-Qx_tC-JZypiLvU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-269476-burrito-casserole-step-06-5ef96fe3ec96436cba1283acc98f551b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269476/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
